  "version": "0.5.2-beta.4",
  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.5.2-beta.3`\n\n### Features\n\n- add a new tab launcher with quick connect and automatic SSH authentication ([5aca30d2](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/5aca30d2f9bacae145fd6918bf0704c70f097526))\n- print the login banner, explain fallbacks and clean up old versions for SSH shell integration ([8e63d4aa](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/8e63d4aaf75127394d51c3c0390661ef734a7a8e))\n- install shell integration on SSH hosts so remote shells mark their commands ([5cb47fd6](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/5cb47fd60be32fc1bc0f34ac50c38aed1442e08b))\n- mark shell commands (OSC 133) to jump between them, copy the last output and show them on the scrollbar ([75b178ad](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/75b178adc808734a5b1c24fa1f9a7d4209a15fa4))\n- add font zoom shortcuts, configurable line height and letter spacing, copy on select and right-click paste ([8bb0e0ec](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/8bb0e0ec0d202bf064a817c1c094b0a3fcb42925))\n- add per-connection terminal colors and a login script for SSH profiles ([9bf2bda0](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/9bf2bda0e55eac539fae7229c2ddf9659b64c984))\n- confirm before pasting multiple lines into a shell without bracketed paste ([430befab](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/430befabb4dc300e2ac95d802b177c481d9a492b))\n- add a per-connection character encoding for SSH sessions (GBK, Big5, Shift_JIS, ...) ([ccf89e15](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/ccf89e151e4b845cd9f50b69a925e24815cd720f))\n\n### Fixes\n\n- time out stalled update requests, retry network failures, and install the downloaded update without re-checking ([881d4b28](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/881d4b288afac93c0e3bf240564b9497ccd04e86))\n\n### UI and usability\n\n- show SSH authentication prompts like the connection dialog, and say when a typed password is kept ([8c7ce4fe](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/8c7ce4feb08604610ceaf573a426c84a92a350ef))\n- keep the window translucent behind terminal prompts when the window blur is on ([bb1b789d](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/bb1b789d440a4d70e5c29844b83576b2e1af8f31))\n- align live broadcast bar labels with their icons ([123deedc](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/123deedce3a8df173a0dbfade4573c19c43b365e))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.5.2-beta.3...v0.5.2-beta.4](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.5.2-beta.3...v0.5.2-beta.4)\n",
